# Never commit your mapping workspace. It holds target company names, owner
# names, and the reasoning behind a live acquisition thesis. Owner names are
# personal data in most jurisdictions. Keep the workspace outside this repo, or
# ignored inside it.
workspace/
my-mapping/
maps/
runs/
*.local.md

